<title>USA: Golden Bear Golf Inc Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Golden Bear Golf Inc Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>GOLDEN BEAR GOLF INC.</p>
<p>		    Financial Highlights (Unaudited)</p>
<p>					     For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							  March 31,</p>
<p> Statement of Operations Data:		  1997	  1996</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>   Golf division			     $3,332,000  $  451,000</p>
<p>   Construction division		    1,271,000   2,056,000</p>
<p>   Marketing division			 2,218,000   1,826,000</p>
