<p>NOTE: Prior to the reorganization of the company on Aug. 1, 1996, the various entities that comprised its operations were S Corporations and therefore not subject to Federal and state income taxes.  Accordingly, a pro forma income tax benefit has been included in pro forma earnings per share for the three months ended March 31, 1996, to present the results of operations as if the respective entities had been C Corporations for both of the periods presented. Certain amounts in the prior period's financial disclosures have been reclassified to conform to the current period presentation.</p>
